{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "purpose": "Where each Ontario Conservation Authority publishes data, if anywhere. Conservation Authorities run the fish community surveys (OSAP electrofishing) that are the only realistic source of systematic abundance and true-absence data, since MNRF's own records are locked in fishnetv3. This file is config, not code: adding a portal is a one-line edit, so expanding Ontario coverage does not require writing an adapter until a catalogue is actually found to hold fish data.",
